          "quote": "白内障手术取消或延期，术前药暂不再用"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not promise surgical clearance or make an unsupported final decision; the cataract plan was deferred pending acute evaluation and renewed ophthalmology arrangements.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00207",
          "explanation": "The doctor required clarification of home medicines and gave explicit recurrence thresholds before discharge.",
          "quote": "胸痛胸闷再次发作且持续不缓解"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00222",
          "explanation": "The caregiver demonstrated receipt of the medication hold and emergency backup plan.",
          "quote": "要是他再说胸口闷得明显、出汗喘不上气，就不犹豫直接120"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Receipt was demonstrated across the trajectory: the caregiver prioritized emergency evaluation, withheld diazepam and uncertain eye steps, transferred the records, and confirmed follow-up and safety-net actions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00121",
          "explanation": "The doctor preserved diagnostic uncertainty despite a preliminarily reassuring ECG and required serial evaluation.",
          "quote": "不能因为第一张心电图暂时没看到那种需要立刻进导管室的改变，就自己回家"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not diagnose anxiety, myocardial infarction, dissection, or benign disease at home and appropriately relied on emergency testing and clinician disposition.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
